WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.644
<v NARRATOR>The team meeting room is quiet.

00:00:01.644 --> 00:00:07.529
<v NARRATOR>The athletic director and someone from the compliance office are standing at the front, and everyone knows why.

00:00:07.529 --> 00:00:09.597
<v NARRATOR>A freshman teammate is in the hospital.

00:00:09.597 --> 00:00:20.361
<v NARRATOR>The captain who organized rookie night, the one who picked the location and set the rules in the group chat, keeps saying the same thing: he wasn't even there when it happened, so how can this be on him?

00:00:20.361 --> 00:00:21.368
<v NARRATOR>Hold that question.

00:00:21.368 --> 00:00:23.012
<v NARRATOR>It matters more than he thinks.
